{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WE\u2019RE STILL HERE</strong> is not just a game.<br>It\u2019s a story about those who stayed. About those who survived. And about those who are gone. We are still here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in a city under siege during the full-scale russian invasion of Ukraine.<br>The game is based on real eyewitness accounts and documentary facts to convey the feeling of despair, fear, and the struggle for life among the ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We do not glorify war.<br>There is only you \u2014 an ordinary person trying to survive in an encircled city while artillery chaotically shells residential areas, enemy troops show no mercy to civilians, and rumors and chaos drive people mad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival in a besieged city</strong> \u2014 resources are limited, and every step outside might be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and craft</strong> \u2014 search for food, medicine, and tools, and create everything necessary to withstand the siege or escape the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op mode</strong> \u2014 play online with friends or other players, share responsibilities, and join forces to increase your chances of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2014 your choices determine your fate: escape the city or remain among its ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong> \u2014 experience what people truly had to endure in reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological depth</strong> \u2014 beyond physical survival, face fear, despair, and the paranoia of spreading rumors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an attempt to preserve the memory of war and make it felt by those who have never lived through a siege.<br>There are no superheroes here. Only people struggling to survive as the city turns into hell.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004610?t=1766931855","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004610?t=1766931855","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004610/a2601b8937c67dfd4e392237552992bda5753c03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766931855","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004610/a2601b8937c67dfd4e392237552992bda5753c03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766931855","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WE\u2019RE STILL HERE</strong> is not just a game.<br>It\u2019s a story about those who stayed. About those who survived. And about those who are gone. We are still here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in a city under siege during the full-scale russian invasion of Ukraine.<br>The game is based on real eyewitness accounts and documentary facts to convey the feeling of despair, fear, and the struggle for life among the ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We do not glorify war.<br>There is only you \u2014 an ordinary person trying to survive in an encircled city while artillery chaotically shells residential areas, enemy troops show no mercy to civilians, and rumors and chaos drive people mad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival in a besieged city</strong> \u2014 resources are limited, and every step outside might be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and craft</strong> \u2014 search for food, medicine, and tools, and create everything necessary to withstand the siege or escape the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op mode</strong> \u2014 play online with friends or other players, share responsibilities, and join forces to increase your chances of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2014 your choices determine your fate: escape the city or remain among its ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong> \u2014 experience what people truly had to endure in reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological depth</strong> \u2014 beyond physical survival, face fear, despair, and the paranoia of spreading rumors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an attempt to preserve the memory of war and make it felt by those who have never lived through a siege.<br>There are no superheroes here. Only people struggling to survive as the city turns into hell.</p>","developers":["MOROZ GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004610/d0c052cf604092fd757d60bcc574d275cb58f7b6/header.jpg?t=1766931855","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>